# Environment Variables

Copy to `.env.local` for local development:

```bash
# Required
PAYLOAD_SECRET=your-random-32-char-secret
NEXT_PUBLIC_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Database — omit DATABASE_URI to use local SQLite (milano.db)
# DATABASE_URI=postgresql://user:pass@host/db?sslmode=require

# Admin seed (first run only)
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@milanonailflowermound.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=ChangeMe123!

# On-demand ISR revalidation
REVALIDATION_SECRET=your-revalidation-secret

# Native ABC booking proxy (creates REAL appointments when enabled)
# ABC_BOOKING_URL=https://abcapp.us/feedback/appointment?appid=tI8PdCO
ABC_BOOKING_ENABLED=false
ABC_BOOKING_MAX_PER_DAY=1

# Optional — Cloudinary (production image CDN)
# CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
# CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
# CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=

# Seed (local/dev only — remove in production after first seed)
SEED_SECRET=your-seed-secret
SEED_ON_START=false
```
